roup of tumor samples can be characterized in terms of the behavior of modules. These modules include clusters of coexpressed genes, such as genes that belong to the same pathway or functional category.  Cancer is a multifaceted phenomenon that involves activation and/or disruption of various cellular processes. Thus, the identification of pathways or group of genes such as those involved in the development of lymph node metastasis and recurrent disease may help understanding the complex biology of cancer. ","gpl":"8173","gse":"22055","taxon":"Homo sapiens","entrytype":"GSE","gdstype":"Expression profiling by array","ptechtype":"","valtype":"","ssinfo":"","subsetinfo":"","pdat":"2010/06/10","suppfile":"TXT","samples":[{"accession":"GSM449833","title":"HNSCC_N+_105_555"},{"accession":"GSM449936","title":"HNSCC_N+_38_647"},{"accession":"GSM449853","title":"HNSCC_N+_147_555"},{"accession":"GSM449919","title":"HNSCC_N+_23_555"},{"accession":"GSM449956","title":"HNSCC_N+_67_647"},{"accession":"GSM449856","title":"HNSCC_N+_14_647"},{"accession":"GSM449876","title":"HNSCC_N+_172_647"},{"accession":"GSM449959","title":"HNSCC_N+_69_555"},{"accession":"GSM548327","title":"HNSCC_N+_31_647"},{"accession":"GSM449979","title":"HNSCC_N+_90_555"},{"accession":"GSM548330","title":"HNSCC_N+_62_555"},{"accession":"GSM449990","title":"HNSCC_N+_99_647"},{"accession":"GSM449890","title":"HNSCC_N+_185_647"},{"accession":"GSM449953","title":"HNSCC_N+_5_555"},{"accession":"GSM449864","title":"HNSCC_N+_163_647"},{"accession":"GSM548318","title":"HNSCC_N+_116_555"},{"accession":"GSM449884","title":"HNSCC_N+_17_647"},{"accession":"GSM449967","title":"HNSCC_N+_74_555"},{"accession":"GSM449930","title":"HNSCC_N+_34_647"},{"accession":"GSM548324","title":"HNSCC_N+_25_555"},{"accession":"GSM449947","title":"HNSCC_N+_53_555"},{"accession":"GSM548321","title":"HNSCC_N+_181_647"},{"accession":"GSM449950","title":"HNSCC_N+_54_647"},{"accession":"GSM449887","title":"HNSCC_N+_184_555"},{"accession":"GSM